<title>UK: Halifax B/S sets 200 mln stg FRN, call.</title>
<headline>Halifax B/S sets 200 mln stg FRN, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HALIFAX BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **25.APR.12</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP FRN   MARGIN   **+25 BP    PAY DATE    25.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.80     FULL FEES   35 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    99.80</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALLABLE YEAR 10 AT PAR, WHEN COUPON STEPS UP TO</p>
<p>		3M LIBOR +125 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    35 BP     SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
